{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YTLYNabXr5Z2Cg6yCT34rn","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_e_hires_profile | — | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- ratequant_greedy_comparison（准备中）\\\\n- compounding_sweep_k10_12（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **compounding_sweep** (success): —\\\\n  [compounding_sweep_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/ratekv/artifacts/compounding_sweep/data/compounding_sweep_results.csv)\\\\n- **exp_d_no_l0_exclusion** (success): —\\\\n- **exp_c_no2bit** (negative): Path B: MCKP solver with {4,8,16}-bit action space (去掉 2-bit). 使用现有 profiling 数据重跑 solver. Pass: auto solver PPL < uniform 4-bit (15.45) by ≥0.5, budget ≤ 0.2500. ← 基于 exp_b_hires_quant\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 6 / 负向 5 / 失败 6 / 共 17\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-37397: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sanity_001: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sanity_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_003: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sanity_003: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 964, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01E2KEH29eT9hsBV3H5dzver","session_id":"69b15b48-5903-4373-bd27-49d1e8a602b8","uuid":"e53bd1be-532d-4ba0-982b-481999ebe6d4","timestamp":"2026-05-14T00:49:21.258Z"}
